OL,3,GNEWSASafety probe after man found dead
OL,4,Aoutside theatre
OL,5,
OL,6,FA health and safety investigation has
OL,7,Fbeen launched alongside an ongoing
OL,8,Fpolice probe after a man was found dead
OL,9,Foutside a theatre in Nottingham city
OL,10,Fcentre.
OL,12,FThe 56-year-old man was found
OL,13,Funresponsive outside the Theatre Royal
OL,14,Fat about 12:10 GMT on Tuesday.
OL,16,FA police spokesperson said the man's
OL,17,Fdeath was "not currently being treated
OL,18,Fas suspicious", and described it as an
OL,19,F"isolated incident". They said a file
OL,20,Fwas being prepared for the coroner.
OL,23,APub: 23-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
