OL,3,GNEWSASafety probe after man found dead
OL,4,Aoutside theatre
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Health and Safety Executive (HSE)
OL,7,Fhas since confirmed it has launched an
OL,8,Finvestigation, which will take place
OL,9,Falongside the main police-led inquiry.
